{
  "uid": "rentcar-backend",
  "title": "RentCar — Backend",
  "description": "Supervision du backend RentCar. Meme fichier en local (Prometheus scrute le conteneur) et en production (l'application pousse vers Grafana Cloud). Publie automatiquement par le pipeline backend-cd.",
  "tags": [
    "rentcar",
    "backend"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROM",
        "label": "Source de donnees",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "description": "Resolue automatiquement : la source provisionnee en local, celle de la pile en Grafana Cloud."
      },
      {
        "name": "application",
        "label": "Application",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(jvm_memory_used_bytes, application)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "description": "Filtre les panneaux si plusieurs services poussent un jour vers la meme pile. Trois reglages evitent la panne la plus sournoise de ce tableau de bord : un panneau vide alors que la metrique existe. label_values() est evalue sur la plage de temps affichee ; sur une plage ou l'instance dormait, il ne renvoie RIEN, la variable devient vide, et les panneaux interrogent alors application=\"\" -- qui ne correspond a aucune serie. Chaque panneau affiche « No data », et l'on soupconne la collecte alors qu'elle fonctionne. D'ou : includeAll, pour que Grafana retombe sur « All » au lieu du vide ; allValue \".*\", regexp que les panneaux appliquent avec =~ (et non =), et qui accepte aussi les series depourvues du libelle ; refresh 2, pour reevaluer la liste a chaque changement de plage."
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Deploiements",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "iconColor": "blue",
        "enable": true,
        "target": {
          "type": "tags",
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": [
            "deploiement"
          ],
          "limit": 100
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Requetes HTTP par seconde",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Trafic reel, par route. Une route qui disparait du graphique n'est plus appelee : souvent le premier signe qu'un ecran du frontend est casse.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Temps de reponse (p95)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "95e percentile, et non la moyenne : la moyenne masque la minorite de requetes lentes, qui est precisement ce que subissent les utilisateurs mecontents.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=~\"$application\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Taux d'erreurs 5xx",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Proportion de reponses 5xx. Un trou dans la courbe signifie « aucune requete sur la periode », et non « aucune erreur » : sans trafic, le taux n'a pas de valeur. Un panneau vide est ici une bonne nouvelle.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"$application\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "erreurs serveur",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Memoire JVM (tas)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "L'instance de production ne dispose que de 512 Mo. Une occupation qui approche le maximum sans redescendre annonce un arret pour depassement memoire.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{application=~\"$application\", area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "utilisee",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{application=~\"$application\", area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "maximum",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Paiements aboutis / echoues",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Metrique metier : elle ne se deduit d'aucune mesure systeme. Un backend parfaitement sain peut n'encaisser aucun paiement.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (increase(rentcar_payments_total{application=~\"$application\"}[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Intentions de paiement (24 h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Compare au panneau voisin : beaucoup d'intentions et peu de paiements aboutis signalent un abandon dans le tunnel.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(rentcar_payment_intents_total{application=~\"$application\"}[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "creees",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Connexions base actives",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Un pool sature met les requetes en attente : l'application parait lente alors que ni le processeur ni la memoire ne bougent.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections_active{application=~\"$application\"}",
          "legendFormat": "actives",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections_max{application=~\"$application\"}",
          "legendFormat": "maximum",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
